Only original artwork owned by the GeoDolly rights holder in `assets/ui/**` and `assets/logo/**` is covered by this paragraph. It is All Rights Reserved. You may load and display supplied copies with an authorized GeoDolly installation for its Permitted Use and make copies technically necessary to install, run, or back up that installation. No permission is granted to extract, edit, republish, redistribute, sell, or use this artwork in another project. A redistributed Software fork must replace or omit reserved artwork and branding unless the rights holder gives separate written permission.

