8. Names and marks

GeoDolly is the public product name; GeoMCP is a project and technical name. This license grants no right to use these names as the main name of an unrelated product, fork, service, domain, or account, or to use the logo, cover, or other reserved brand artwork in another project. Do not present a fork or hosted service as official or imply sponsorship or approval. You may accurately identify the original project in plain text, such as "Based on GeoDolly" or "Based on GeoMCP," if your own name is clearly different. No statement here claims that a mark is registered in any jurisdiction or limits references independently allowed by applicable law.

