Keep this license and existing attribution notices with every copy you distribute. Comply with applicable law and with the separate terms of any data source, service, or third-party component you use. POLICY.md explains the use categories and states the intended policy of any future official hosted service; it does not enlarge the rights granted here. Rights not expressly granted are reserved. Nothing in this license limits rights you have independently under applicable law.

10. Breach and termination

If you breach a condition of this license, your rights under it end. If this is your first breach and you fully remedy it and its practical effects within 30 days after written notice from the relevant copyright holder, your rights are reinstated. Rights already granted to a compliant recipient of a copy do not end solely because you breach your own license.

